  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At an indoor climbing gym, Xingtian's chairwoman finds Chun Yuqiao healthier and more relaxed than she has ever seen him during their years working together. Listen to Chun Yuqiao and Bu Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "运动这才是我的主业。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我过去老来这儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "每次来这儿就特别开心，特别放松。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是后来进了电视圈之后，就没这时间了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在挺好的，每天都能来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "公司里大家都还好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在你的平台上，员工发展不会有错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有些事情，总要学会面对。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，您好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想来看看您。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "运动这才是我的主业。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sports were actually my true calling all along.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我过去老来这儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I used to come here all the time in the past.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "每次来这儿就特别开心，特别放松。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every time I came here, I felt especially happy and relaxed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是后来进了电视圈之后，就没这时间了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet once I entered the television industry, I never had time for it anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在挺好的，每天都能来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Things are pretty great now, since I can come every single day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "公司里大家都还好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is everyone back at the company doing alright?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "那就好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is good to hear.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在你的平台上，员工发展不会有错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On the platform you built, employees are bound to grow well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "有些事情，总要学会面对。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Some things in life simply have to be faced.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，您好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是布小谷。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is Bu Xiaogu.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想来看看您。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I would like to come check on you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
